Disable the runtime's outgoing model and media download client.

All common model/Hugging Face/Docker downloads and server HTTP(S) media
loads use common_http_client. Reject before parsing the URL, resolving DNS,
or constructing a network client. The loopback HTTP server remains available.
Umbratic provisions revision-pinned, checksum-verified models itself and sends
media as inline data. Its chat and speech launches also request --offline.

